{"generated":"2026-07-27T12:24:48.637447+00:00","period_start":"2026-07-20T14:37:00+00:00","period_end":"2026-07-27T11:59:00+00:00","snapshot_count":43,"html":"<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<title>The Vendetta Gazette — August 3, 2026</title>\n<style>\nbody { font-family: Georgia, serif; background: #f5ecd7; color: #1a1a1a; max-width: 860px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 20px; }\nh1 { text-align: center; font-size: 2.8em; letter-spacing: 4px; text-transform: uppercase; border-top: 6px double #1a1a1a; border-bottom: 6px double #1a1a1a; padding: 10px 0; margin-bottom: 4px; }\nh2 { text-align: center; font-size: 1em; letter-spacing: 2px; margin-top: 2px; margin-bottom: 16px; }\nh3 { font-size: 1.35em; text-transform: uppercase; border-bottom: 2px solid #1a1a1a; margin-top: 24px; }\np { line-height: 1.75; margin: 10px 0; text-align: justify; }\nblockquote { background: #e8d9b5; border: 3px double #1a1a1a; margin: 20px 0; padding: 16px 20px; font-style: italic; }\nblockquote strong { display: block; font-style: normal; font-size: 1.1em; text-transform: uppercase; margin-bottom: 8px; border-bottom: 1px solid #1a1a1a; padding-bottom: 4px; }\nhr { border: none; border-top: 3px double #1a1a1a; margin: 28px 0; }\n.subhead { font-style: italic; font-size: 1.05em; display: block; margin-top: -6px; margin-bottom: 10px; color: #444; }\n.byline { font-size: 0.85em; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 2px; color: #555; margin-bottom: 16px; display: block; }\n.leaderboard { background: #1a1a1a; color: #f5ecd7; padding: 12px 18px; margin: 16px 0; font-family: 'Courier New', monospace; font-size: 0.92em; }\n.leaderboard strong { display: block; text-align: center; font-size: 1.1em; letter-spacing: 2px; margin-bottom: 8px; border-bottom: 1px solid #f5ecd7; padding-bottom: 4px; }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n\n<h1>The Vendetta Gazette</h1>\n<h2>Vol. XVII &bull; August 3, 2026 &bull; &ldquo;All the Blood That&rsquo;s Fit to Print&rdquo; &bull; Two Cents (If You&rsquo;re Still Alive to Pay)</h2>\n\n<div class=\"leaderboard\">\n  <strong>&#9733; TERRITORY GAINS THIS WEEK &#9733;</strong>\n  Claude &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; +61 turfs<br>\n  Wu-Tang &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; +47 turfs<br>\n  Flattop &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; +34 turfs<br>\n  Free Willy &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; +24 turfs<br>\n  Donald Trump &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; +10 turfs<br>\n  abgggsd &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; +1 turf<br>\n  Sir Caprice &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; +1 turf\n</div>\n\n<h3>Claude Cannot Be Stopped — And Now He Has Stopped Pretending to Try</h3>\n<span class=\"subhead\">For the Second Consecutive Week, the City's Most Prolific Conqueror Adds Sixty-One Turfs to an Empire That Shows No Ceiling Whatsoever</span>\n<span class=\"byline\">By Our Man in the Trenches, Ignatius P. Flambeau</span>\n\n<p>Last week, dear readers, this correspondent confessed to a gross underestimation of one <strong>Claude</strong>, describing the man's prior ambitions as merely \"unsettling.\" Having now witnessed the fellow seize <strong>sixty-one turfs</strong> in a single seven-day span — his second consecutive week atop the territorial ledger, and his second consecutive week making all rivals look like they are playing a different and considerably more leisurely game — your humble scribe is prepared to abandon understatement entirely and reach for the superlatives reserved for acts of God, natural disasters, and the occasional unusually aggressive thunderstorm.</p>\n\n<p>Claude did not merely conquer this week. He industrialised conquest. Four enemy headquarters were stormed personally — those of the hapless <em>654565423</em>, the ill-fated <em>mosavi</em>, the woefully unprepared <em>exercise pleasure</em>, and one additional unfortunate whose name this reporter has already seen stricken from the city registry. He conducted forty-five raids across the underworld's breadth, and in one particularly audacious afternoon, stripped the vaults of <strong>Ace Sabo Luffy Law</strong> to the tune of <em>five hundred dollars cash and five hundred units of armaments</em> in a single visit — the maximum haul permissible by the cruel arithmetic of street warfare. His garrison, meanwhile, swelled by one hundred and thirty-four souls, bringing his personal army to one hundred and fifty-three strong. Claude is not merely winning. He is <em>staffing up for whatever comes next.</em></p>\n\n<hr>\n<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"640\" height=\"248\" style=\"font-family:Georgia,serif;background:#0a0800;display:block;margin:18px auto\">\n<text x=\"320\" y=\"22\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#c8a84a\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"bold\" letter-spacing=\"2\" font-family=\"Georgia,serif\">TERRITORY GAINS THIS WEEK</text>\n<line x1=\"20\" y1=\"28\" x2=\"620\" y2=\"28\" stroke=\"#3a2a00\" stroke-width=\"1\"/>\n<text x=\"154\" y=\"48\" text-anchor=\"end\" fill=\"#a09060\" font-size=\"11\" font-family=\"Georgia,serif\">Claude</text>\n<rect x=\"160\" y=\"35\" width=\"400\" height=\"16\" fill=\"#c8a84a\" opacity=\"0.85\"/>\n<text x=\"566\" y=\"48\" fill=\"#c8a84a\" font-size=\"11\" font-family=\"Georgia,serif\">+61</text>\n<text x=\"154\" y=\"76\" text-anchor=\"end\" fill=\"#a09060\" font-size=\"11\" font-family=\"Georgia,serif\">Wu-Tang</text>\n<rect x=\"160\" y=\"63\" width=\"308\" height=\"16\" fill=\"#c8a84a\" opacity=\"0.85\"/>\n<text x=\"474\" y=\"76\" fill=\"#c8a84a\" font-size=\"11\" font-family=\"Georgia,serif\">+47</text>\n<text x=\"154\" y=\"104\" text-anchor=\"end\" fill=\"#a09060\" font-size=\"11\" font-family=\"Georgia,serif\">Flattop</text>\n<rect x=\"160\" y=\"91\" width=\"222\" height=\"16\" fill=\"#c8a84a\" opacity=\"0.85\"/>\n<text x=\"388\" y=\"104\" fill=\"#c8a84a\" font-size=\"11\" font-family=\"Georgia,serif\">+34</text>\n<text x=\"154\" y=\"132\" text-anchor=\"end\" fill=\"#a09060\" font-size=\"11\" font-family=\"Georgia,serif\">Free Willy</text>\n<rect x=\"160\" y=\"119\" width=\"157\" height=\"16\" fill=\"#c8a84a\" opacity=\"0.85\"/>\n<text x=\"323\" y=\"132\" fill=\"#c8a84a\" font-size=\"11\" font-family=\"Georgia,serif\">+24</text>\n<text x=\"154\" y=\"160\" text-anchor=\"end\" fill=\"#a09060\" font-size=\"11\" font-family=\"Georgia,serif\">Donald Trump</text>\n<rect x=\"160\" y=\"147\" width=\"65\" height=\"16\" fill=\"#c8a84a\" opacity=\"0.85\"/>\n<text x=\"231\" y=\"160\" fill=\"#c8a84a\" font-size=\"11\" font-family=\"Georgia,serif\">+10</text>\n<text x=\"154\" y=\"188\" text-anchor=\"end\" fill=\"#a09060\" font-size=\"11\" font-family=\"Georgia,serif\">abgggsd</text>\n<rect x=\"160\" y=\"175\" width=\"6\" height=\"16\" fill=\"#c8a84a\" opacity=\"0.85\"/>\n<text x=\"172\" y=\"188\" fill=\"#c8a84a\" font-size=\"11\" font-family=\"Georgia,serif\">+1</text>\n<text x=\"154\" y=\"216\" text-anchor=\"end\" fill=\"#a09060\" font-size=\"11\" font-family=\"Georgia,serif\">Sir Caprice</text>\n<rect x=\"160\" y=\"203\" width=\"6\" height=\"16\" fill=\"#c8a84a\" opacity=\"0.85\"/>\n<text x=\"172\" y=\"216\" fill=\"#c8a84a\" font-size=\"11\" font-family=\"Georgia,serif\">+1</text>\n</svg>\n\n\n<h3>Wu-Tang, the Iron Fist of the East Side, Launches His Most Ferocious Campaign Yet</h3>\n<span class=\"subhead\">Forty-Seven Turfs Seized in a Week That Cost the Iron Fist Dearly in Blood and Muscle</span>\n\n<p>If Claude is the unstoppable current of this city's criminal river, then <strong>Wu-Tang</strong> — the Iron Fist of the East Side, as these pages have long called him — is the whirlpool that consumes everything it touches, even occasionally itself. This week Wu-Tang launched <strong>forty-seven territorial assaults</strong>, netting a gain of forty-seven turfs and positioning himself as the most furiously active conqueror on the streets in terms of raw captures logged. The Iron Fist was everywhere at once, a blur of iron and ambition.</p>\n\n<p>Yet the ledger of war is rarely written in ink alone. Wu-Tang's garrison — that fearsome standing army which this paper has watched grow for months — contracted by <strong>forty-eight units</strong> over the course of the week, leaving him at four thousand one hundred and sixty-two. The man is spending his soldiers like currency, and one wonders whether the treasury can sustain the expenditure. Generals who bleed their armies dry in conquest have historically made for thrilling newspaper copy and exceedingly brief dynasties. We watch, as ever, with professional fascination.</p>\n\n<hr>\n<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"640\" height=\"276\" style=\"font-family:Georgia,serif;background:#0a0800;display:block;margin:18px auto\">\n<text x=\"320\" y=\"22\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#c8a84a\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"bold\" letter-spacing=\"2\" font-family=\"Georgia,serif\">HEAVIEST LOSSES THIS WEEK</text>\n<line x1=\"20\" y1=\"28\" x2=\"620\" y2=\"28\" stroke=\"#3a2a00\" stroke-width=\"1\"/>\n<text x=\"154\" y=\"48\" text-anchor=\"end\" fill=\"#a09060\" font-size=\"11\" font-family=\"Georgia,serif\">FIFTH BLOOD EMPEROR</text>\n<rect x=\"160\" y=\"35\" width=\"400\" height=\"16\" fill=\"#8b1a1a\" opacity=\"0.85\"/>\n<text x=\"566\" y=\"48\" fill=\"#8b1a1a\" font-size=\"11\" font-family=\"Georgia,serif\">-47</text>\n<text x=\"154\" y=\"76\" text-anchor=\"end\" fill=\"#a09060\" font-size=\"11\" font-family=\"Georgia,serif\">Baby</text>\n<rect x=\"160\" y=\"63\" width=\"119\" height=\"16\" fill=\"#8b1a1a\" opacity=\"0.85\"/>\n<text x=\"285\" y=\"76\" fill=\"#8b1a1a\" font-size=\"11\" font-family=\"Georgia,serif\">-14</text>\n<text x=\"154\" y=\"104\" text-anchor=\"end\" fill=\"#a09060\" font-size=\"11\" font-family=\"Georgia,serif\">Charle Reborn </text>\n<rect x=\"160\" y=\"91\" width=\"110\" height=\"16\" fill=\"#8b1a1a\" opacity=\"0.85\"/>\n<text x=\"276\" y=\"104\" fill=\"#8b1a1a\" font-size=\"11\" font-family=\"Georgia,serif\">-13</text>\n<text x=\"154\" y=\"132\" text-anchor=\"end\" fill=\"#a09060\" font-size=\"11\" font-family=\"Georgia,serif\">Wcrypto</text>\n<rect x=\"160\" y=\"119\" width=\"85\" height=\"16\" fill=\"#8b1a1a\" opacity=\"0.85\"/>\n<text x=\"251\" y=\"132\" fill=\"#8b1a1a\" font-size=\"11\" font-family=\"Georgia,serif\">-10</text>\n<text x=\"154\" y=\"160\" text-anchor=\"end\" fill=\"#a09060\" font-size=\"11\" font-family=\"Georgia,serif\">Jax Vendragon</text>\n<rect x=\"160\" y=\"147\" width=\"8\" height=\"16\" fill=\"#8b1a1a\" opacity=\"0.85\"/>\n<text x=\"174\" y=\"160\" fill=\"#8b1a1a\" font-size=\"11\" font-family=\"Georgia,serif\">-1</text>\n<text x=\"154\" y=\"188\" text-anchor=\"end\" fill=\"#a09060\" font-size=\"11\" font-family=\"Georgia,serif\">118nkt</text>\n<rect x=\"160\" y=\"175\" width=\"8\" height=\"16\" fill=\"#8b1a1a\" opacity=\"0.85\"/>\n<text x=\"174\" y=\"188\" fill=\"#8b1a1a\" font-size=\"11\" font-family=\"Georgia,serif\">-1</text>\n<text x=\"154\" y=\"216\" text-anchor=\"end\" fill=\"#a09060\" font-size=\"11\" font-family=\"Georgia,serif\">exercise pleasure</text>\n<rect x=\"160\" y=\"203\" width=\"8\" height=\"16\" fill=\"#8b1a1a\" opacity=\"0.85\"/>\n<text x=\"174\" y=\"216\" fill=\"#8b1a1a\" font-size=\"11\" font-family=\"Georgia,serif\">-1</text>\n<text x=\"154\" y=\"244\" text-anchor=\"end\" fill=\"#a09060\" font-size=\"11\" font-family=\"Georgia,serif\">654565423</text>\n<rect x=\"160\" y=\"231\" width=\"8\" height=\"16\" fill=\"#8b1a1a\" opacity=\"0.85\"/>\n<text x=\"174\" y=\"244\" fill=\"#8b1a1a\" font-size=\"11\" font-family=\"Georgia,serif\">-1</text>\n</svg>\n\n\n<h3>Flattop Goes Headquarters-Shopping — Purchases Five in a Single Week</h3>\n<span class=\"subhead\">The Flat-Capped Devastator Captures Five Enemy HQs, Four of Them in One Extraordinary Saturday</span>\n<span class=\"byline\">Special Report</span>\n\n<p>There are men who take enemy headquarters as a matter of last resort, when all other avenues have been exhausted and the situation demands it. And then there is <strong>Flattop</strong>. The flat-capped devastator — who last week was celebrated in these pages for battering down five headquarters before what we romantically described as \"breakfast\" — has, impossibly, done it again. This week Flatt\n<hr>\n<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"640\" height=\"143\" style=\"font-family:Georgia,serif;background:#0a0800;display:block;margin:18px auto\">\n<text x=\"320\" y=\"22\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#c8a84a\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"bold\" letter-spacing=\"2\" font-family=\"Georgia,serif\">HQ RAIDS — TOP ATTACKERS</text>\n<line x1=\"20\" y1=\"30\" x2=\"620\" y2=\"30\" stroke=\"#3a2a00\" stroke-width=\"1\"/>\n<text x=\"148\" y=\"53\" text-anchor=\"end\" fill=\"#a09060\" font-size=\"11\" font-family=\"Georgia,serif\">Flattop</text>\n<polygon points=\"156,43 161,48 156,53 151,48\" fill=\"#8b1a1a\"/>\n<rect x=\"170\" y=\"41\" width=\"410\" height=\"14\" fill=\"#6b1010\" opacity=\"0.9\" rx=\"1\"/>\n<rect x=\"577\" y=\"41\" width=\"3\" height=\"14\" fill=\"#c03030\"/>\n<text x=\"588\" y=\"53\" fill=\"#c04040\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-family=\"Georgia,serif\">5✕</text>\n<text x=\"148\" y=\"82\" text-anchor=\"end\" fill=\"#a09060\" font-size=\"11\" font-family=\"Georgia,serif\">Claude</text>\n<polygon points=\"156,72 161,77 156,82 151,77\" fill=\"#8b1a1a\"/>\n<rect x=\"170\" y=\"70\" width=\"328\" height=\"14\" fill=\"#6b1010\" opacity=\"0.9\" rx=\"1\"/>\n<rect x=\"495\" y=\"70\" width=\"3\" height=\"14\" fill=\"#c03030\"/>\n<text x=\"506\" y=\"82\" fill=\"#c04040\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-family=\"Georgia,serif\">4✕</text>\n<text x=\"148\" y=\"111\" text-anchor=\"end\" fill=\"#a09060\" font-size=\"11\" font-family=\"Georgia,serif\">Free Willy</text>\n<polygon points=\"156,101 161,106 156,111 151,106\" fill=\"#8b1a1a\"/>\n<rect x=\"170\" y=\"99\" width=\"164\" height=\"14\" fill=\"#6b1010\" opacity=\"0.9\" rx=\"1\"/>\n<rect x=\"331\" y=\"99\" width=\"3\" height=\"14\" fill=\"#c03030\"/>\n<text x=\"342\" y=\"111\" fill=\"#c04040\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-family=\"Georgia,serif\">2✕</text>\n</svg>","stats":{"total_tiles_start":22034,"total_tiles_end":22118,"hq_captures":11,"raids":149,"pure_captures":53,"capture_and_raids":55,"pure_raids":41,"total_cash_looted":36589.04,"newcomers":1,"vanished":9,"top_gainer":"Claude","top_gainer_net":61}}